---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';

const updated = '2026-09-07';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | The Cone Sleeves"
  description="How The Cone Sleeves collects, uses and protects the information you provide when requesting a quote or contacting us."
  path="/privacy-policy/"
  crumbs={[{ name: 'Privacy Policy', path: '/privacy-policy/' }]}
>
  <section class="section-tight" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--paper-blush),var(--paper))">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-line">Legal</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="form-note">Last updated 7 September 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-narrow prose">
      <p>
        This policy describes how {SITE.name} (&ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;us&rdquo; or &ldquo;our&rdquo;) collects,
        uses and discloses information about people who visit
        <a href="/">our custom packaging printing site</a> and about our customers and
        prospective customers. By using this site you agree to it.
      </p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Contact details you give us.</strong> Your name, email address, phone number and
          anything else you type into a quote or contact form, including artwork files you attach.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Usage information collected automatically.</strong> Your IP address, browser type,
          the pages you view and the date and time of your visit. This reaches us through Google
          Tag Manager and the live chat widget, which set cookies in your browser.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Anything else you choose to send.</strong> For example, replies to an email
          thread, or details you share while chatting with us.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To answer your enquiry, prepare a quote and produce an order;</li>
        <li>To operate, secure and improve this website;</li>
        <li>To contact you about work in progress or a previous order;</li>
        <li>To comply with a legal obligation.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We do not sell your information, and we do not add you to a marketing list because you
        asked for a quote.
      </p>

      <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
      <p>
        We share information with the service providers who run parts of this operation for us:
        website hosting, email delivery, analytics and live chat. They may only use it to provide
        that service. We will also disclose information where the law requires it, or where it is
        necessary to protect our rights or someone&rsquo;s safety.
      </p>

      <h2>Artwork and files you send us</h2>
      <p>
        Artwork you upload is used to quote, proof and print your job, and is retained so a repeat
        order can be run from the same file. We do not use your artwork as a portfolio sample or
        show it to another customer without your permission. Ask us and we will delete it.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        You can opt out of any promotional email using the link in it; we may still send messages
        about an order in progress. You can block or delete cookies in your browser, though the
        chat widget will stop working if you do. To ask what we hold about you, or to have it
        corrected or deleted, email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Security</h2>
      <p>
        We take reasonable measures to protect information from loss, misuse and unauthorized
        access. No method of transmission over the internet is completely secure, so we cannot
        guarantee absolute security.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>
        This site sells to businesses. It is not directed at children, and we do not knowingly
        collect information from anyone under 13.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy to reflect changes in our practices or the law, and the date at
        the top will change with it. Questions about this policy or how we handle your data go to
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> or {SITE.phone}.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
